    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "There's an ability for people in private to acknowledge a whole bunch of things that everyone knows to be true. The introduction of cameras to everywhere that the Senate tries to do its work except the classified spaces around Intel, which frankly are some of the most constructive bipartisan environments usually and that's",
