      {
        "text": "There are moments when the body politic needs policies unpopular with a majority of people.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Standing for unpopular policies may result in losing an election in the short term.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
