    "turn_text": "Obviously, he meant it as a joke, but it's also fairly tragic because in the American system of government, he is supposed to be the boss of the representative government that we put in place so that if he and his neighbors don't think that they're being well served in the netting out of some hard trade off choices by the public officials that work for them, they're supposed to be able to fire them.",
